* Singularity简介

.image singularity.jpg _ 1000

* Singularity安装 - 1.1 两种安装方法

- 通过RPM or DEB 安装

.link https://github.com/sylabs/singularity/releases  SingularityCE 3.10.2


* Singularity安装 - 1.2 配置修改

    sudo sed -i 's/shared loop devices = no/shared loop devices = yes/g' \
    /usr/local/etc/singularity/singularity.conf

* Singularity命令 - 2.1 拉取预编译镜像

    1）拉取ubuntu镜像
    $ singularity pull docker://ubuntu:22.04

    2）拉取centos镜像
    $ singularity pull docker://centos:8

* Singularity命令 - 2.2 运行镜像

    交互式运行
    $ singularity run ubuntu_22.04.sif

    执行命令并退出
    $ singularity run ubuntu_22.04.sif pwd
    $ singularity run ubuntu_22.04.sif ls /bin  

* Singularity命令 - 2.3 挂载外部目录

    $ singularity run -B /opt:/opt ubuntu_22.04.sif
    
    体会一下不同
    $ singularity run ubuntu_22.04.sif ls /opt
    $ singularity run -B /opt:/opt ubuntu_22.04.sif ls /opt
    
* Singularity打包命令行应用 - 3.1 目录

    ├── README.md
    ├── app
    │   ├── hello.py
    │   └── requirements.txt
    ├── hello.def
    └── hello.sh

* Singularity打包命令行应用 - 3.2 hello.py 

.code -numbers ../tutorials/tutorial01/app/hello.py

* Singularity打包命令行应用 - 3.3 def文件

.code -numbers ../tutorials/tutorial01/hello.def  /hello.def/,/%post/

* Singularity打包命令行应用 - 3.3 def文件

.code -numbers ../tutorials/tutorial01/hello.def  /%post/,/singularity run/

* Singularity打包命令行应用 - 3.4 打包
    $ cd ../tutorials/tutorial01/
    $ sudo singularity build hello_v0.1.sif hello.def

* Singularity打包命令行应用 - 3.5 运行

    $ singularity run hello_v0.1.sif 10 20
    30
    $ singularity run hello_v0.1.sif 66 100
    166

