* Singularity打包pi并行计算 - 5.4 打包
    $ cd ../tutorials/tutorial03/
    $ sudo singularity build cpi_v0.1.sif cpi.def

* Singularity打包pi并行计算 - 5.5 运行
    $ singularity run cpi_v0.1.sif /opt/app/cpi
    Process 0 of 1 is on cn01
    pi is approximately 3.1415926535898389, Error is 0.0000000000000457
    wall clock time = 7.680963

    $ singularity run cpi_v0.1.sif mpirun -n 8 /opt/app/cpi
    Process 4 of 8 is on cn01
    ...
    Process 2 of 8 is on cn01
    pi is approximately 3.1415926535897949, Error is 0.0000000000000018
    wall clock time = 0.968542

*   Singularity打包pi并行计算 - 5.5 运行
    $ singularity run cpi_v0.1.sif mpirun -n 16 /opt/app/cpi
    Process 4 of 8 is on cn01
    ...
    Process 13 of 16 is on cn01
    pi is approximately 3.1415926535896892, Error is 0.0000000000001039
    wall clock time = 0.486354

    $ singularity run cpi_v0.1.sif mpirun -n 32 /opt/app/cpi
    Process 4 of 8 is on cn01
    ...
    Process 27 of 32 is on cn01
    pi is approximately 3.1415926535898584, Error is 0.0000000000000653
    wall clock time = 0.261127

*   Singularity打包pi并行计算 - 5.6 多节点运行

    mpirun  --mca btl_tcp_if_include 192.168.0.0/24 \
    --host master:48,cn01:16 singularity run cpi_v0.2.sif cpi

    singularity run cpi_v0.2.sif mpirun --mca btl_tcp_if_include 192.168.0.0/24 \
    --host master:48,cn01:32 cpi

    Process 34 of 80 is on master
    Process 44 of 80 is on master
    ...
    Process 31 of 80 is on master
    pi is approximately 3.1415926535897984, Error is 0.0000000000000053
    wall clock time = 0.213129


    备注：ip route show 查看通信路由

